      },
      "text": "Before talking about models, understand how prices actually get formed:"
    },
    {
      "id": "00-OVERVIEW.md#016",
      "path": [
        "00-OVERVIEW.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:finance:00-overview, git-history:finance:00-overview]",
        "canonical_path": "finance/00-OVERVIEW.md",
        "concepts": "[overview]",
        "current_path": "finance/00-OVERVIEW.md",
        "id": "maxim:finance:overview",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "finance",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[overview]",
        "section": "finance",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Quantitative Finance - Field Map and Orientation",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nORDER BOOK (Level 2 data)\n──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n  ASK (sells)                BID (buys)\n  ┌──────────────┐          ┌──────────────┐\n  │ $100.05  10  │          │ $100.00  25  │\n  │ $100.04  30  │          │  $99.99  100 │\n  │ $100.03  15  │ ← Ask    │  $99.98  50  │\n  │ $100.02  50  │          │  $99.97  200 │\n  └──────────────┘          └──────────────┘\nSpread = $100.02 - $100.00 = $0.02 (2 cents)"
    },
    {
      "id": "00-OVERVIEW.md#017",
      "path": [
        "00-OVERVIEW.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:finance:00-overview, git-history:finance:00-overview]",
        "canonical_path": "finance/00-OVERVIEW.md",
        "concepts": "[overview]",
        "current_path": "finance/00-OVERVIEW.md",
        "id": "maxim:finance:overview",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "finance",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[overview]",
        "section": "finance",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Quantitative Finance - Field Map and Orientation",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Best bid shown: $100.00 for 25 units.\nMarket order: executes immediately at best available price\nLimit order: sits in book until match found or cancelled\nMarket maker: provides liquidity both sides; profit = spread × volume\nMarket taker: demands liquidity; pays spread"
    },
    {
      "id": "00-OVERVIEW.md#018",
      "path": [
        "00-OVERVIEW.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:finance:00-overview, git-history:finance:00-overview]",
        "canonical_path": "finance/00-OVERVIEW.md",
        "concepts": "[overview]",
        "current_path": "finance/00-OVERVIEW.md",
        "id": "maxim:finance:overview",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "finance",
