      "text": "```\nFORM            CLAIM                           IMPLICATION\n─────────────── ──────────────────────────────  ──────────────────────────────────\nWeak form       Prices reflect all past prices  Technical analysis cannot work\n                (historical return data)         (excess return over buy-and-hold)"
    },
