      "text": "## The Mathematical Toolkit"
    },
    {
      "id": "00-OVERVIEW.md#028",
      "path": [
        "00-OVERVIEW.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:finance:00-overview, git-history:finance:00-overview]",
        "canonical_path": "finance/00-OVERVIEW.md",
        "concepts": "[overview]",
        "current_path": "finance/00-OVERVIEW.md",
        "id": "maxim:finance:overview",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "finance",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[overview]",
        "section": "finance",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Quantitative Finance - Field Map and Orientation",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nMATH AREA           HOW IT APPEARS IN FINANCE\n────────────────    ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nProbability         Asset return distributions, risk-neutral pricing measure\nStochastic calc.    Itô's lemma, SDEs, Black-Scholes PDE, diffusion models\nOptimization        Markowitz frontier, LQR in execution, convex portfolio opt.\nLinear algebra      Factor models, PCA on returns, covariance matrix estimation\nStatistics          Regression for factor loadings, hypothesis testing returns\nPDEs                Black-Scholes PDE, heat equation ← same PDE after transform\nMonte Carlo         Option pricing (path-dependent), VaR, stress scenarios\nTime series         ARIMA/GARCH for volatility modeling, cointegration for pairs\nGraph theory        Systemic risk network models, contagion\nInformation theory  Entropy in portfolio construction, Kelly criterion\nGame theory         Market microstructure (Cournot-Nash in oligopolies)\n```"
    }
